  "description": "Pruning of 2no. Cherry trees (T1 and T3) and 1no. Hawthorn tree (T2) in the front playground subject to Tree Preservation Order TPO/213/12/95, by crown reduction by 2m all round to leave trees 6m tall and 4m wide.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The works to the three TPO trees (two Cherry and one Hawthorn) hereby approved shall only comprise the following and must be carried out in accordance with British Standard BS3998:2010 - Recommendations for Tree Work:\r\n\r\n- The pruning of the subject tree's crown, specifically to reduce the tree crown's by 2m. \r\n\r\nTo prevent unnecessary loss or mutilation to the tree, in accordance with Policies DC8 and OS5 of the Local Plan (2018).",
    "Condition : 2 - No less than five working days' notice shall be given to the Council's Aboricultural Officer before any work commences on trees (Telephone 020 8748 3020). In order that the Council has the opportunity to ensure that the work is carried out in accordance with Condition 1, in accordance with Policies DC8 and OS5 of the Local Plan (2018)."
